  "app_overview_title": "What makes IRIS different",
  "app_overview_intro": "IRIS organizes playback around scenarios and adds abilities ordinary players never had. Purpose and usage of each are noted below; reopen from Settings → About.",
  "app_overview_about_tile_title": "IRIS feature guide",
  "app_overview_about_tile_sub": "What is different from a normal player",
  "app_overview_scenario_title": "Scenarios & the Playing workspace",
  "app_overview_scenario_body": "Switch playback sources without re-selecting files.\nAll playback uses the same \"Playing\" workspace, resolving the actual files from the given sources; saved scenarios act as plans, loaded via Override or merged via Append.",
  "app_overview_tag_title": "Tags & numeric commands",
  "app_overview_tag_body": "For switching back and forth among videos in a large library. After marking video #x and later playing video #x+1000, the two still switch quickly between each other.\nTags are collections, not folders.\nDesktop shortcuts: +n.m.x / -n add or remove the current file to/from the given tag ordinals; *n / *0 switch the queue view during playback.",
  "app_overview_vm_title": "Virtual media (merged playback)",
  "app_overview_vm_body": "Multiple videos joined into one continuous timeline for scrubbing and back-to-back playback.\nCustom rules merge them automatically, matching against the persistent media library (database) — effectively a two-dimensional playlist; disk files are untouched.",
  "app_overview_bg_title": "Sub Audio (second player)",
  "app_overview_bg_body": "When the picture is acceptable but the audio is not, play another video's audio instead.\nSub Audio runs as a second player alongside the picture; the frame turns blue when the controls drive Sub Audio.",
  "app_overview_identity_title": "Custom app entries (name / icon / scenario)",
  "app_overview_identity_body": "Customize the app name, or pin different playback habits to different entries that start directly without browsing folders.\nCreate extra desktop/home-screen entries with their own name, icon and bound scenario (optionally a tag).",
  "app_overview_library_title": "Scanned media library (all media / all dirs / path tree)",
  "app_overview_library_body": "Browse the library in All Media / All Directories / Path Tree views.\nThe library is a persistent database; scans start from the file browser's refresh menu, and offline files stay visible (greyed out).",
  "app_overview_desktop_title": "Desktop (PotPlayer-style controls)",
  "app_overview_desktop_body": "Aligned as closely as possible with PotPlayer keys and habits.\nA PotPlayer-style keyboard scheme, offering only functions that are actually supported.",
  "app_overview_phone_title": "Phone one-handed control (landscape ring dial + screen gestures)",
  "app_overview_phone_body": "One-handed optimization for landscape video; the Gesture guide lets the layout be viewed and edited.\nA one-handed ring-dial scrubber keeps everything controllable with one hand.",
